          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "SPAN\n\nSpan is a node similar to the Read node.\nIt takes a collection and reads a part of the collection.\nYou tell the Span node how much you want to read using the Size inlet.\nYou tell the Span node where to begin reading using the Begin inlet."
          }
        },
